410546d5.poster.avif?t=1782582436\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301790/extras/cff1c624c67e9596dceb7f00410546d5.webm?t=1782582436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301790/extras/cff1c624c67e9596dceb7f00410546d5.mp4?t=1782582436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt the adventurers</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are not the hero.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fight roaming explorers<br>• Raid their camps<br>• Face stronger enemies each time<br>• Survive chaotic encounters</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The more you win, the harder it gets.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301790/extras/ed9d4e8ee1e875c613dde88a4a3ed082.poster.avif?t=1782582436\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301790/extras/ed9d4e8ee1e875c613dde88a4a3ed082.webm?t=1782582436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301790/extras/ed9d4e8ee1e875c613dde88a4a3ed082.mp4?t=1782582436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relaxed, not rushed</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress at your own pace.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure to grind  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No long sessions required  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for a few minutes or stay longer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a friend!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep systems. Simple runs.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the monster. </strong><br><strong>Hunt the heroes. </strong><br><strong>Break the curse.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-alig